      "risk_7d": "60% MEDIUM",
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "Offshore of Southwestern Mexico:\nA trough of low pressure located several hundred miles south of the \ncoast of southwestern Mexico is producing disorganized showers and \nthunderstorms. Gradual development of this system is possible, and a \ntropical depression could form during the middle or latter portions \nof next week while the system moves generally west-northwestward at \n10 to 15 mph.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...near 0 percent.\n* Formation chance through 7 days...medium...60 percent.",
